{"id":"4723b54e4035a6fb","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-pratt-tree-certificate.md","title":"递归素性证书的有限树定义与编码","display":"df-pratt-tree-certificate — 递归素性证书的有限树定义与编码","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-pratt-tree-certificate","aliases":["73-df-pratt-tree-certificate"],"display":"df-pratt-tree-certificate — 递归素性证书的有限树定义与编码","depends_on":["[[73-thm-full-order-primality-criterion]]","[[73-df-ordered-tree-domain]]","[[73-df-binary-natural-representation]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§11.5.5, Theorem 11.26, print pp. 519–521; PDF pp. 541–543; explicit corrected certificate","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":11},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-pratt-tree-certificate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-pratt-tree-certificate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pratt-tree-certificate — 递归素性证书的有限树定义与编码"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ff00e4aa0ef74db8\" href=\"?note=ff00e4aa0ef74db8\" title=\"73-thm-full-order-primality-criterion\">73-thm-full-order-primality-criterion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"018ebd908b6f5c76\" href=\"?note=018ebd908b6f5c76\" title=\"73-df-ordered-tree-domain\">73-df-ordered-tree-domain</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bc88ca69b33d5036\" href=\"?note=bc88ca69b33d5036\" title=\"73-df-binary-natural-representation\">73-df-binary-natural-representation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§11.5.5, Theorem 11.26, print pp. 519–521; PDF pp. 541–543; explicit corrected certificate"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 为候选证书，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TreeDom}(D)\">\\(\\operatorname{TreeDom}(D)\\)</span> 与节点子数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_D\">\\(\\kappa_D\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"018ebd908b6f5c76\" href=\"?note=018ebd908b6f5c76\" title=\"73-df-ordered-tree-domain\">73-df-ordered-tree-domain</a>。结构谓词的定义不预设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 有效。在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PC}_c\">\\(\\operatorname{PC}_c\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PrattCode}\">\\(\\operatorname{PrattCode}\\)</span> 的递归子句中固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PrattCert}(c,n)\">\\(\\operatorname{PrattCert}(c,n)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c=(D,N,A)\">\\(c=(D,N,A)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N:D\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\">\\(N:D\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A:D\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(A:D\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是该证书的唯一分量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in D\">\\(d\\in D\\)</span>，子节点下标为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,\\kappa_D(d)\\}\">\\(j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,\\kappa_D(d)\\}\\)</span>。局部整除检验中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是在断言中量化的指数见证；对未通过乘积检验的候选标签不调用非整数指数的模幂。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{PrattCert}(c,n)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists D\\in\\{E:\\operatorname{TreeDom}(E)\\}\\;\\exists N:D\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\;\\exists A:D\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl[&amp;\nc=(D,N,A)\\land N(\\varepsilon)=n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall d\\in D\\;\\bigl[\n(N(d)=2\\land\\kappa_D(d)=0\\land A(d)=0)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\lor(N(d)&gt;2\\land\\kappa_D(d)\\ge1\\land1\\le A(d)&lt;N(d)\n\\land\\prod_{j=1}^{\\kappa_D(d)}N(d\\langle j\\rangle)=N(d)-1\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{Pow}_{N(d)}(A(d),N(d)-1)=1\n\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,\\kappa_D(d)\\}\\;\n\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl[N(d\\langle j\\rangle)e=N(d)-1\\land\\operatorname{Pow}_{N(d)}(A(d),e)\\ne1\\bigr])\\bigr]\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{PrattCert}(c,n)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists D\\in\\{E:\\operatorname{TreeDom}(E)\\}\\;\\exists N:D\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\;\\exists A:D\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl[&amp;\nc=(D,N,A)\\land N(\\varepsilon)=n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall d\\in D\\;\\bigl[\n(N(d)=2\\land\\kappa_D(d)=0\\land A(d)=0)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\lor(N(d)&gt;2\\land\\kappa_D(d)\\ge1\\land1\\le A(d)&lt;N(d)\n\\land\\prod_{j=1}^{\\kappa_D(d)}N(d\\langle j\\rangle)=N(d)-1\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{Pow}_{N(d)}(A(d),N(d)-1)=1\n\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,\\kappa_D(d)\\}\\;\n\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl[N(d\\langle j\\rangle)e=N(d)-1\\land\\operatorname{Pow}_{N(d)}(A(d),e)\\ne1\\bigr])\\bigr]\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PC}_c(d)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{NumCode}(N(d))\\operatorname{NumCode}(A(d))\n\\operatorname{NumCode}(\\kappa_D(d))\n\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{j=1}^{\\kappa_D(d)}\\operatorname{PC}_c(d\\langle j\\rangle),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{PrattCode}(c)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{PC}_c(\\varepsilon).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PC}_c(d)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{NumCode}(N(d))\\operatorname{NumCode}(A(d))\n\\operatorname{NumCode}(\\kappa_D(d))\n\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{j=1}^{\\kappa_D(d)}\\operatorname{PC}_c(d\\langle j\\rangle),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{PrattCode}(c)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{PC}_c(\\varepsilon).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个非叶节点记录 n−1 的素因子列表，允许重复；各孩子递归证明这些因子确为素数。节点编码按有限树递归并携带子数，可唯一解析。第一项幂同余是修订后明确增加的检查，不能只检验排除较小阶。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-thm-full-order-primality-criterion","status":"resolved","id":"ff00e4aa0ef74db8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-full-order-primality-criterion]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-ordered-tree-domain","status":"resolved","id":"018ebd908b6f5c76","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-ordered-tree-domain]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-natural-representation","status":"resolved","id":"bc88ca69b33d5036","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-natural-representation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-ordered-tree-domain","status":"resolved","id":"018ebd908b6f5c76","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$c$ 为候选证书，$n\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\operatorname{TreeDom}(D)$ 与节点子数 $\\kappa_D$ 见 [[73-df-ordered-tree-domain]]。结构谓词的定义不预设 $c$ 有效。在 $\\operatorname{PC}_c$ 与 $\\operatorname{PrattCode}$ 的递归子句中固定 $\\operatorname{PrattCert}(c,n)$ 和 $c=(D,N,A)$，其中 $N:D\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}$、$A:D\\to\\mathbb N$ 是该证书的唯一分量；$d\\in D$，子节点下标为 $j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,\\kappa_D(d)\\}$。局部整除检验中的 $e\\in\\mathbb N$ 是在断言中量化的指数见证；对未通过乘积检验的候选标签不调用非整数指数的模幂。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TreeDom}(D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa_D","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PC}_c","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PrattCode}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PrattCert}(c,n)","display":false},{"tex":"c=(D,N,A)","display":false},{"tex":"N:D\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}","display":false},{"tex":"A:D\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in D","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,\\kappa_D(d)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"e\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{PrattCert}(c,n)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists D\\in\\{E:\\operatorname{TreeDom}(E)\\}\\;\\exists N:D\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}\\;\\exists A:D\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl[&\nc=(D,N,A)\\land N(\\varepsilon)=n\\\\\n&\\land\\forall d\\in D\\;\\bigl[\n(N(d)=2\\land\\kappa_D(d)=0\\land A(d)=0)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\lor(N(d)>2\\land\\kappa_D(d)\\ge1\\land1\\le A(d)<N(d)\n\\land\\prod_{j=1}^{\\kappa_D(d)}N(d\\langle j\\rangle)=N(d)-1\\\\\n&\\qquad\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{Pow}_{N(d)}(A(d),N(d)-1)=1\n\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,\\kappa_D(d)\\}\\;\n\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl[N(d\\langle j\\rangle)e=N(d)-1\\land\\operatorname{Pow}_{N(d)}(A(d),e)\\ne1\\bigr])\\bigr]\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PC}_c(d)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{NumCode}(N(d))\\operatorname{NumCode}(A(d))\n\\operatorname{NumCode}(\\kappa_D(d))\n\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{j=1}^{\\kappa_D(d)}\\operatorname{PC}_c(d\\langle j\\rangle),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{PrattCode}(c)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{PC}_c(\\varepsilon).","display":true}],"bytes":2724,"backlinks":[{"id":"34c08ba68aabce9a","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-pratt-tree-certificate]]"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-297","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-pratt-tree-certificate|递归素性证书的有限树定义与编码]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"d182dd0cac33ba74","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["ff00e4aa0ef74db8","018ebd908b6f5c76","bc88ca69b33d5036"]}